# ops/base-images/vendor-refs.allow — image references in the public tree that
# name a subscription registry (ops/base-images/base-images.py, ADR 1220).
#
# Each line is a deployed third-party image with no publicly redistributable
# build: the public tree points at the vendor's own free image, which every
# user pulls from the vendor under the vendor's terms; goat redistributes
# nothing built on it. This list only SHRINKS: when a public build exists, pin
# it in the role default and delete the line.
#
# Format: <path> <key>   # reason
#   role default -> key is the variable name
#   compose      -> key is the image without its digest
ops/ansible/roles/minio/defaults/main.yml minio_image   # upstream minio/minio images are gone; Chainguard's free image is the only maintained one
ops/ansible/roles/minio/defaults/main.yml minio_mc_image   # upstream minio/mc images are gone; same
ops/ansible/roles/audit-fifo-evict/defaults/main.yml audit_fifo_evict_mc_image   # the same Chainguard minio-client the minio role pins; upstream minio/mc images are gone
ops/ansible/roles/audit-fifo-evict/deploy-history.yml cgr.dev/chainguard/minio-client:latest-dev   # the ledger row for that pin
